         ],
         "note": "stamped but badly over-inked, the counters filled. The second figure is a solid blob, wider than the 1s beside it, which suits a 4, but another day in November 1925 cannot be ruled out. Roll number 3329 from crop 3 and the leader label in crop 4, 'Symphonie Pathetic Op. 74, Part I (final), P. Tschaikowsky'; crop 2 blank"
        }
       ]
      }
